    {
      "id": "atW63SrPUk1VGHp360Onb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 611.4885402321427,
      "y": 1137.4975714285713,
      "width": 662.51953125,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 520519609,
      "version": 781,
      "versionNonce": 855619127,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793184513814,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Processing block = its own dispatch + its own cores \n(one of N side-by-side units).\n\nProcessing blocks run one warp at a time: the dispatcher fetches\none instruction once, every thread of the warp executes it \non its own core with its own data (SIMD). \n\nN processing blocks = N warps running at one instance.\n\nThe SM holds many more warps than that (all warps of all its\nresident blocks); the rest wait their turn.\n\nMore threads than cores; the warp runs in rounds (32 threads on 8\ncores = 4 rounds), still one instruction.\n\nA warp never crosses blocks, and a block never crosses SMs.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Processing block = its own dispatch + its own cores \n(one of N side-by-side units).\n\nProcessing blocks run one warp at a time: the dispatcher fetches\none instruction once, every thread of the warp executes it \non its own core with its own data (SIMD). \n\nN processing blocks = N warps running at one instance.\n\nThe SM holds many more warps than that (all warps of all its\nresident blocks); the rest wait their turn.\n\nMore threads than cores; the warp runs in rounds (32 threads on 8\ncores = 4 rounds), still one instruction.\n\nA warp never crosses blocks, and a block never crosses SMs.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
